#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.7.rst:4
msgid "v4.1.7"
msgstr "v4.1.7"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.7.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.1.7 is a maintenance release that refreshes the bundled OpenMV firmware "
"to version 4.5.4 across every supported board and updates the bundled RTSP "
"streaming examples. It remains based on Qt Creator 10.0.1, and there are no "
"breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"v4.1.7 adalah rilis pemeliharaan yang memperbarui firmware OpenMV yang "
"disertakan ke versi 4.5.4 di semua papan yang didukung dan memperbarui "
"contoh streaming RTSP yang disertakan. Rilis ini tetap berbasis Qt Creator "
"10.0.1, dan tidak ada perubahan yang memecak."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.7.rst:14
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Pada halaman ini"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.7.rst:17
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Sorotan"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.7.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Bundled firmware updated to v4.5.4** for all supported boards, so a fresh "
"install or reflash ships the latest firmware out of the box."
msgstr ""
"**Firmware yang disertakan diperbarui ke v4.5.4** untuk semua papan yang "
"didukung, sehingga instalasi baru atau reflash menyertakan firmware terbaru "
"langsung dari kotak."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.7.rst:23
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Perubahan dan perbaikan lainnya"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.7.rst:25
msgid ""
"Updated the bundled **OpenMV firmware to v4.5.4** (from v4.5.3) for all "
"supported boards, including OpenMV Cam M2/M4/H7/H7 Plus, OpenMVPT, RT1060, "
"Arduino Giga, Portenta H7, Nicla Vision, Nano RP2040 Connect, and Nano 33 "
"BLE Sense. This refreshes the relevant ``firmware``, ``openmv``, ``uvc``, "
"and bootloader binaries per board (not all binary types exist for every "
"board). (`8b802c970 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/8b802c970>`__)"
msgstr ""
"Memperbarui **firmware OpenMV yang disertakan ke v4.5.4** (dari v4.5.3) "
"untuk semua papan yang didukung, termasuk OpenMV Cam M2/M4/H7/H7 Plus, "
"OpenMVPT, RT1060, Arduino Giga, Portenta H7, Nicla Vision, Nano RP2040 "
"Connect, dan Nano 33 BLE Sense. Ini memperbarui biner ``firmware``\\ , "
"``openmv``\\ , ``uvc``\\ , dan bootloader yang relevan per papan (tidak "
"semua jenis biner ada untuk setiap papan). (\\ `8b802c970 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8b802c970>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.7.rst:32
msgid ""
"Refreshed the bundled RTSP video server examples "
"(``rtsp_video_server_lan.py`` and ``rtsp_video_server_wlan.py``) with notes "
"pointing users at the IDE's built-in FFPLAY-based viewer (``Tools`` -> "
"``Video Tools`` -> ``Play RTSP Stream``) and guidance on configuring VLC for"
" low-latency playback, including installing ``live555``/``livemedia-utils`` "
"on Linux and reducing the VLC network caching value. (`8b802c970 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8b802c970>`__)"
msgstr ""
"Memperbarui contoh server video RTSP yang disertakan (\\ "
"``rtsp_video_server_lan.py`` dan ``rtsp_video_server_wlan.py``\\ ) dengan "
"catatan yang mengarahkan pengguna ke penampil berbasis FFPLAY bawaan IDE (\\"
" ``Tools`` -> ``Video Tools`` -> ``Play RTSP Stream``\\ ) dan panduan "
"mengonfigurasi VLC untuk pemutaran latensi rendah, termasuk menginstal "
"``live555``\\ /\\ ``livemedia-utils`` di Linux dan mengurangi nilai caching "
"jaringan VLC. (\\ `8b802c970 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/8b802c970>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.7.rst:42
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Dukungan platform dan alat"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.7.rst:44
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 10.0.1."
msgstr "**Basis Qt Creator:** 10.0.1."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.7.rst:45
msgid "**Bundled OpenMV firmware:** 4.5.4 (was 4.5.3)."
msgstr "**Firmware OpenMV yang disertakan:** 4.5.4 (sebelumnya 4.5.3)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.7.rst:48
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Perubahan yang Memecak"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.7.rst:50
msgid ""
"None. This release is drop-in compatible with v4.1.6; no project or workflow"
" changes are required."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada. Rilis ini kompatibel langsung dengan v4.1.6; tidak ada perubahan "
"proyek atau alur kerja yang diperlukan."
